## Custom post types

### Product CPT

Use a CPT for catalog products.

Suggested key:

```text
selecta_product
```

Public behavior:

```text
Public: yes
Archive: yes
Single pages: yes
REST: yes
Supports:
  - title
  - editor
  - thumbnail
  - excerpt
  - revisions
```

Do not use the WooCommerce product post type.

Suggested taxonomies:

```text
selecta_product_category
selecta_product_line
selecta_hair_type
selecta_hair_concern
```

Examples of category/filter concepts from the PHYTO reference:

```text
Product type:
  - shampoo
  - conditioner
  - mask
  - leave-in care
  - oil
  - styling
  - color
  - supplements
  - travel size

Hair type:
